Output: 1.2 Sanitation systems rehabilitated, constructed and improved. 
Indicator: Rehabilitated 2.7 km and constructed 7.7 km sewerage collectors and networks in Andijan City 
Progress/Status: 2.719 km of  800 mm sewer collector rehabilitated;

5.640 km of 800-1000 mm diameter sewer collector constructed

2.315 km of 400 mm diameter sewerage networks constructed;

0.061 km 600 mm diameter sewerage networks constructed;

1.12 km of 150 - 300 mm diameter sewerage networks were constructed. 
Data Source: Vodokanal records, financial reports, and performance benchmarking report. Project progress reports. Project performance monitoring system. Review missions Project completion report. 
